Please look back over the replies; Haavard mentioned how to apply the zero slope constraint.
You’ll also want to look into the scale model option that can help for setting reasonable priors.
But that one makes more sense when including the slope constraint, and since that
isn’t applied by default, I’m not sure what the implementation does for that one,
so others will have to answer that...

Finn

